{"seq":36,"slug":"cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics","title":"加密货币与区块链经济学","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics","rating":{"composite":3.85,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 加密货币与区块链经济学\n\n区块链网络不是纯技术构造——每条链都是一个经济系统，用激励约束参与者行为、用市场机制分配稀缺资源、用治理结构协调集体决策。本 hub 从经济学视角解剖这套系统：机制设计如何防止作恶、代币供需怎样影响价格发现、DeFi 协议背后的利率曲线与套利逻辑、以及监管框架对市场结构的重塑效应。\n\n## 与兄弟 hub 的分工\n\n- [博弈论](../09_game-theory/_INTRODUCTION.md)：提供纳什均衡、机制设计等形式化工具——本 hub 应用这些工具于共识、MEV、DAO 投票的具体场景\n- [市场设计与机制设计](../25_market-design-mechanism-design/_INTRODUCTION.md)：覆盖拍卖理论、匹配市场、激励兼容的一般理论——本 hub 聚焦区块链原生的应用实例\n- [金融科技基础](../04_fintech-fundamentals/_INTRODUCTION.md)：讨论支付系统、数字银行、监管科技的广义框架——本 hub 仅处理去中心化和加密原生部分\n- [期权与衍生品定价](../35_options-derivatives-pricing/_INTRODUCTION.md)：期权定价模型（Black-Scholes、Greeks）——本 hub 聚焦永续合约的 funding rate 机制和链上衍生品结构\n- [智能合约安全](../31_smart-contract-security/_INTRODUCTION.md)：代码审计与漏洞——本 hub 分析经济攻击（闪电贷套利、治理攻击的经济条件）\n- [DeFi 协议设计](../32_defi-protocol-design/_INTRODUCTION.md)：协议架构与实现——本 hub 分析其背后的经济模型与均衡条件\n\n## 学习路径\n\n建议按章节顺序阅读：「基础层经济学」建立共识激励与代币经济学的框架 → 「DeFi 协议经济学」运用这些框架分析 AMM/借贷/MEV → 「市场动态」考察价格发现与稳定机制 → 「治理与监管」处理制度层约束。每章内的文档可独立阅读，但前置章节的概念会被后续章节引用。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 微观经济学基础（供需、均衡、弹性）\n- 博弈论初步（纳什均衡、激励兼容）\n- 金融学基础（利率、折现、无套利原理）\n- 对区块链技术有基本了解（区块、交易、哈希、公私钥）即可，不要求深入密码学或分布式系统知识\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础层经济学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"consensus-incentive-design","title":"共识机制与激励设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/foundations/consensus-incentive-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tokenomics-supply-demand","title":"代币经济学：供需模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/foundations/tokenomics-supply-demand"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mining-staking-economics","title":"挖矿与质押经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/foundations/mining-staking-economics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"defi-protocols","title":"DeFi 协议经济学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/defi-protocols","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"amm-liquidity-pool","title":"AMM 与流动性池机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/defi-protocols/amm-liquidity-pool"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lending-borrowing-protocols","title":"借贷协议经济模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/defi-protocols/lending-borrowing-protocols"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mev-transaction-ordering","title":"MEV 与交易排序经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/defi-protocols/mev-transaction-ordering"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"market-dynamics","title":"市场动态与价格机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crypto-market-microstructure","title":"加密市场微观结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/crypto-market-microstructure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stablecoin-mechanism-design","title":"稳定币机制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/stablecoin-mechanism-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"derivatives-perpetuals","title":"加密衍生品与永续合约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/derivatives-perpetuals"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"governance-regulation","title":"治理与监管经济学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/governance-regulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dao-governance-economics","title":"DAO 治理经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/governance-regulation/dao-governance-economics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"regulatory-framework-compliance","title":"监管框架与合规经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/governance-regulation/regulatory-framework-compliance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cbdc-digital-currency","title":"央行数字货币经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/governance-regulation/cbdc-digital-currency"}]}]}